# ============================================================
# Cloudflare _redirects for philippinehoegen.com
# Place this file in: public/_redirects
# Astro copies it to dist/ at build time.
#
# Format (one rule per line):
#   [source]   [destination]   [status code]
#
# Limits: 2,000 static + 100 dynamic rules (2,100 total),
#         max 1,000 characters per line.
#
# Rules:
#   - Lines starting with # are comments (no inline comments).
#   - The first matching rule wins, so keep specific rules
#     at the top and splat/placeholder rules at the bottom.
#   - Always add 301 for permanent moves (default is 302).
#   - List both the no-slash and slash version of old URLs
#     so each redirects in a single hop.
# ============================================================


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Static redirects: old project pages -> new works pages
# ------------------------------------------------------------

/projecten/fld75    /works/presentation-performing-working    301
/projecten/fld75/   /works/presentation-performing-working    301

# Copy this pair for each additional page:
# /projekten/OLD-SLUG    /works/NEW-SLUG    301
# /projekten/OLD-SLUG/   /works/NEW-SLUG    301


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Section-level redirects (old index pages)
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# /projekten     /works    301
# /projekten/    /works    301


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. External redirects (short links to other sites)
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# /instagram    https://www.instagram.com/YOUR-HANDLE    302


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Dynamic redirects (keep these LAST)
#    Counts toward the 100 dynamic-rule limit.
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Catch-all for any remaining /projekten/* URLs where the slug
# stayed the same on the new site:
/projecten/*    /works/:splat    301

